WEBVTT

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.570
Um, Captain?

00:02:08.570 --> 00:02:11.690
Yomo? Minami?

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:14.280
Senpai...

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.670
Huh?

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:35.050
What's this?

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:48.860
Huh?! N-No way!

00:02:48.860 --> 00:02:52.030
Hey! Turn this back to normal!

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:54.110
Wh-Whoa!

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.450
It's all back...

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.580
You understand me.

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:06.290
Sit.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.250
Lie down.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.420
Paw.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.630
Not quite, but whatever.

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:17.300
You need a name, don't you?

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:22.310
Um, let's give you a cool one.

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:27.900
All right. Your name will be Goldburn.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:29.640
What Are These Overlapping Emotions?

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:29.640
Episode 9

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:32.320
Going to the festival, Yomogi?

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:33.860
There's fireworks.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.820
Super crummy ones.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:37.240
You going?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:44.280
38th Uzukigaoka Fireworks Festival

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.240
I can't make it.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:41.030
It's my brother's birthday.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.450
I've got plans to go eat.

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:44.580
Me, too.

00:03:44.580 --> 00:03:46.620
Why don't you two go?

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:50.540
No way.

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:56.130
Not interested in the festival?

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:59.680
Huh? Uh, not really.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.760
I think I wanna go.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:06.390
Huh? Should we check it out?

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.560
Mmm.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:11.610
I'll ask the others
since I bet they're bored.

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.690
Think Knight will come?

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.530
Hmm. Don't know.

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:21.200
Oh. No way to reach him.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.240
Just let me know.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:26.500
Okay.

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:28.040
Senpai.

00:04:28.040 --> 00:04:29.040
Hmm?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.920
Hypothetically, if there was
a peaceful <i>kaiju </i>that understood--

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.710
Oh, sorry. Hello?

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.920
Hey, Yomogi.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.630
Festival?

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.890
I've got nothing going on.

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.890
Yeah.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:46.640
I'll see if Chise--

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:48.770
Huh?

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:52.650
Ugh, I'm spent.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:54.020
Captain Gauma.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.280
Hmm? What's up?

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:58.400
Hypothetically...

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.950
Just hypothetically...

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:06.490
If there was a peaceful <i>kaiju</i>
that understood people, what then?

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:11.250
You're thinking about
that last <i>kaiju</i>, huh?

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:16.630
We've gotta fight any <i>kaiju</i>
that poses a threat.

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.920
That's our duty.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:22.300
A-Absolutely!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:30.390
Shoot. I've gotta keep Goldburn
a secret. If anyone finds--

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.610
Wh-What?! What?!

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:44.950
No, no, no! Too big, too big! Shrink,
Goldburn! Go back to being small!

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:47.700
You're not listening at all.

00:06:03.970 --> 00:06:05.840
Awesome!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.890
Huh?

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:12.100
The lousy Ayame Middle School...

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.400
Huh?! Goldburn?!

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:18.150
W-Wait, wait! No!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.570
I almost became a Kaiju Eugenicist.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.410
Sorry, Goldburn.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.450
38th Uzukigaoka Fireworks Festival
We're excited to see you there!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.420
Yomogi!

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:36.250
Mmm?

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:37.960
You've got a guest.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:38.960
Huh?

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:45.840
I'm Futaba Senda, the chorus club grad.

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:51.220
Any progress?

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.140
With what?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.440
You guys dating?

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.020
Shut up.

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:02.440
Hello?

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:05.990
Minami? Futaba just showed up here.

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:07.030
Huh?

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:10.370
Um, all right.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.660
Sorry, I've gotta go back.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:13.700
Why?

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.170
I'm super sorry.

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.080
The boyfriend, huh?!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:19.790
Ex-boyfriend!

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.670
That girl...

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.350
I've got this one.

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:34.390
It does seem right up your alley.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.310
You've got this.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:38.850
Instance Domination.

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:52.030
I heard from my old work
that you guys were looking for me.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.160
Sorry to bother you.

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:57.000
You're Kano's little sister, right?

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.000
Yeah. Yume Minami.

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.340
Is it true that you two were dating?

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:06.090
Yeah, we were at the time.

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:12.010
So, you knew that she was
being bullied in chorus club?

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:16.680
I heard rumors about it,
but I never saw it in person.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:21.650
Besides, people don't just
admit they're being bullied.

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:25.030
That's true...

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:28.110
But it made Kano commit suicide.

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:35.160
No. Even the police
concluded it was an accident.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:41.710
I wonder... Was it really?

00:08:41.710 --> 00:08:46.210
Kano wasn't like that.
She wouldn't kill herself.

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.440
Sorry, I've gotta get going.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:03.730
Okay.

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:04.770
Bye.

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.320
Why?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:19.790
If you were dating Kano,
why didn't you save her?!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.630
Yeah, most people would think that.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:34.300
What's that mean?

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:42.100
Minami--

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:51.150
A <i>kaiju</i>? At a time like this?

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:53.860
Let's go, Yomogi.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.950
Are you okay?

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:58.490
Yeah. Let's hurry.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.410
R-Right.

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:11.920
Sorry, go on ahead. I'll be right there.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:12.970
But--!

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:15.050
I'm fine, really.

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:17.760
Go.

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:20.220
All right.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:38.530
What now? When you're this big,
I can't bring you home.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:41.580
Another <i>kaiju</i>?!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:44.620
Huh?

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:51.130
H-Hey! Wait! Wait up, Goldburn!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:59.640
Dyna Launcher Burst Missile!

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:10.610
Shit! The ground!

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:13.530
We can't fight this alone!

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:16.860
Where the hell are Yomogi and Yume?!

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:20.740
With this <i>kaiju</i>, I can beat Gauma at last!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.240
You know...

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.960
Don't get too worked up.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:26.710
We have a guest.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:34.090
Be careful out there, Knight.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.270
Having trouble, Gauma?

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:48.060
The whole team's not here yet!

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:54.030
Gauma!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:56.030
You're late, Yomogi!

00:11:57.280 --> 00:11:59.280
Hey, where's Yume?

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:01.990
She'll probably be here shortly.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:05.790
What's "probably"?! What happened to her?

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:07.830
About that...

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:13.340
She met with her sister's ex
and was acting a bit strange.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:16.260
And? You just ditched her?

00:12:16.260 --> 00:12:18.180
No, I left because--

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:19.680
Hey!

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:21.800
Go get Yume right now!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:22.430
Huh?

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:28.560
What have you been around her for?!
You can tell that she's acting strange!

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:32.520
I-I... I'll go get her!

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:38.740
Come back together. You're the only one
who can bring her back!

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:39.990
Right!

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:48.910
If there's something
only I can do, I've gotta do it.

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:56.000
It's no use. I totally lost him.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.010
Hmm?

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.840
Minami?

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:07.720
What are you doing here?

00:13:10.270 --> 00:13:13.190
Isn't there a <i>kaiju</i>?

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.740
Um, shouldn't you be helping?

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:24.030
I know. I know that.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.500
What's the matter?

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:33.670
I'm fine. I'm fine, and it's got
nothing to do with you.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:43.090
When I fight, nothing good
ever comes from it.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:50.060
I wish you wouldn't say that.

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:54.560
I try to fight as part of
the team, you know.

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.980
So don't say it's got
nothing to do with me!

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:02.780
A <i>kaiju</i>?!

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:04.320
No, that's--!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:06.990
Minami!

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:14.630
Minami! You okay?!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.710
Yomogi...

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.720
I came... to get you.

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:35.400
Minami, are you sure
nothing good came from it?

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:39.320
This guy charged in to save you.

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:42.990
Is there anyone else
that would do that for you?

00:14:46.450 --> 00:14:49.540
You don't know what you've got.

00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.210
Minami!

00:15:01.210 --> 00:15:02.090
Huh?

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.510
Minami!

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:14.480
Kano...

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:29.320
The <i>kaiju</i>... saved her?

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:36.960
That's Goldburn, my friend!

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:39.590
A friend... <i>kaiju</i>?

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:47.380
Knight Bursting Light Bom--

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.470
Knight!

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:50.350
I-I can't move!

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:52.640
Shit! We're screwed!

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:57.640
Gauma! I will now surpass you!

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:59.860
We're really sinking!

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:02.650
Yomogi! Where are you?!

00:16:04.070 --> 00:16:05.030
Gauma!

00:16:05.030 --> 00:16:07.200
Sorry we're late!

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.950
You're late as hell, you two!

00:16:15.580 --> 00:16:18.370
Huh? What's going on?

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:20.540
What's up with that <i>kaiju</i>?

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.380
What's wrong?

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:28.930
I can't control it. No, it's rejecting me.

00:16:28.930 --> 00:16:32.050
This <i>kaiju </i>can hear my heart!

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:33.180
Your heart?

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:36.810
Captain! Please trust this <i>kaiju</i>!

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:39.060
Chise's telling the truth!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.980
It saved us!

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:44.730
This <i>kaiju </i>is my friend!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.280
If Chise says so, it must be true.

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:58.620
All right. Since I believe in you guys,
I'll believe in the <i>kaiju</i>, too!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:21.690
Combine Dragon Dynazenon!

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.730
Go, Goldburn!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:26.780
What?!

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:29.150
Let's save him while we're at it!

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:38.700
I didn't need help.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:43.000
Don't get me wrong. It wasn't to help you.

00:17:45.340 --> 00:17:50.470
Quit with the flirting.
I'll wipe you both out at once!

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:59.930
Goldburn has the power
to protect everyone!

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:03.060
It's time to put our powers together!

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:04.230
Right!

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:03.370
Super Dragon King Kaiser Gridknight!

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:11.550
What the hell is that?!

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:14.220
All of 'em lumped together.

00:19:14.220 --> 00:19:18.100
The giant, Dynazenon,
and <i>kaiju </i>became one.

00:19:21.470 --> 00:19:25.480
That still doesn't mean
you're gonna beat me!

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:41.450
So fast!

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:43.250
And strong! We've got this!

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:44.540
Yeah!

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:49.710
This is the power of all of us together!

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:57.300
Kaiser Knight Double Storm!

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:03.140
Shoot!

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:08.230
Yomogi Asanaka!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:10.230
Dynamic Cannon!

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:14.940
Rex...

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:16.860
...Grid...

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:19.820
...Fire!

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:53.320
Well, you almost had it, Juuga.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:56.690
We'll win next time, yeah?

00:20:56.690 --> 00:21:01.700
There's not an infinite number
of <i>kaiju</i>, you know.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:03.450
That's true.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:08.540
I realized something today.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:14.290
We've all gotta fight together.
We can't win without everyone.

00:21:16.050 --> 00:21:17.630
Even me?

00:21:17.630 --> 00:21:21.180
Including you... and Goldburn.

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:30.140
We're too late for the festival.

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:32.690
No, not if we run.

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:34.060
All right!

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:35.320
Right now?

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:37.530
C'mon, get moving!

00:21:39.030 --> 00:21:40.740
You guys, too.

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.920
We didn't make it.

00:21:53.920 --> 00:21:55.420
Guess not.

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:57.880
Who wants to do fireworks?

00:21:57.880 --> 00:21:58.710
Huh?

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:00.260
Like, our own.

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:04.300
That's a great idea!
We'll go and buy some!

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:06.640
Huh? Okay.

00:22:06.640 --> 00:22:08.930
I wanna buy some, too!

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:11.520
Huh? O-Okay.

00:22:11.520 --> 00:22:13.810
Can I go home for a sec?

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:15.270
What for?

00:22:15.270 --> 00:22:17.730
I'll be right back.

00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:28.330
Minami sure is late.

00:22:28.330 --> 00:22:30.410
Yeah, it's been a while.

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:32.370
Late, yet again?

00:22:32.370 --> 00:22:34.170
I'll go get her.

00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:48.720
Sorry for taking so long.
